# Project One – Phishing Simulation SOC Lab

## 📌 Overview

This project demonstrates a phishing attack simulation in a controlled SOC lab environment.  
  The workflow covers:
- Crafting and importing a phishing email (`phish.eml`) into Thunderbird.
- Clicking the malicious link to trigger Edge and download a payload from Kali.
- Capturing Sysmon logs and Splunk detections.
- Documenting the SOC analyst workflow (Tier‑1 → Tier‑2 → Tier‑3).
- Mapping activity to MITRE ATT&CK techniques.

👉 All screenshots are stored in the [`project1`](./project1) folder.

